oo heavy.\n\nThe side dishes are also impressive—diverse and delicious 😋, perfect to pair with the ramen. Prices are reasonable, offering great value for money.\n\nOrdering is done via QR code on your phone, which is convenient, and payment can be made by cash or Line Pay.\nAs ramen enthusiasts, we highly recommend this place 👍",null,[0,54]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10230217714778257961/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZVZKcVZtNVVSazAwVkZWV1VHTnNWbmhUTW5oS1dqSjNNRXhZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10230217714778257961/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZVZKcVZtNVVSazAwVkZWV1VHTnNWbmhUTW5oS1dqSjNNRXhZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10230217714778257961/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZVZKcVZtNVVSazAwVkZWV1VHTnNWbmhUTW5oS1dqSjNNRXhZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10230217714778257961/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZVZKcVZtNVVSazAwVkZWV1VHTnNWbmhUTW5oS1dqSjNNRXhZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10230217714778257961/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZVZKcVZtNVVSazAwVkZWV1VHTnNWbmhUTW5oS1dqSjNNRXhZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10230217714778257961/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZVZKcVZtNVVSazAwVkZWV1VHTnNWbmhUTW5oS1dqSjNNRXhZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1988,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oeVJqVm5URk00VFVWUGNsVnhTMnhKWjJ3MExYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x3bcb721b38cbe049!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmhyRjVnTFM4TUVPclVxS2xJZ2w0LXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oeVJqVm5URk00VFVWUGNsVnhTMnhKWjJ3MExYYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oeVJqVm5URk00VFVWUGNsVn